    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9444731a_1d3609bd",
        "filename": "virtualizationservice/src/crosvm.rs",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 608,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-28T16:15:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `read` returns a `Result`, don\u0027t we want to `?` it, or at least log it?\n\ne.g.\n```\nif let Some(pvmfw_path) \u003d system_properties::read(\"hypervisor.pvmfw.path\")? {\n    command.arg(\"--protected-vm-with-firmware\").arg(pvmfw_path)\n} else {\n    command.arg(\"--protected-vm\")\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 608,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 608,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "eddc04649917824b0549df088ca7e536b3ae5937",
